sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant R as Query2Resource
    participant Thin as ThinQueryService
    participant Discover as OlapDiscoverService
    participant CM as ConnectionManager
    participant OLAP as olap4j/Mondrian
    participant Format as Result formatter
    Client->>R: POST /query/execute + ThinQuery
    R->>Thin: ejecutar
    Thin->>Thin: inferir tipo / crear MDX si querymodel
    Thin->>Discover: resolver conexión
    Discover->>CM: obtener conexión
    CM->>OLAP: recuperar conexión
    Thin->>OLAP: crear statement + ejecutar MDX
    OLAP-->>Thin: CellSet
    Thin->>Format: convertir matriz y ejes
    Format-->>R: QueryResult
    R-->>Client: JSON o Arrow negociado
    Thin->>OLAP: cerrar statement en finally
